    "title": {
      "en": "Executing Market Orders with Spread and Slippage Awareness",
      "zh": "在考虑点差与滑点的情况下执行市价单"
    },
    "shortTitle": {
      "en": "market order",
      "zh": "在考虑点差与滑点的情况下执行市价单"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates executing market orders with spread and slippage awareness using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示在考虑点差与滑点的情况下执行市价单。"
    },
    "categoryId": "trade_execution",
