        "Explain the core decision rules behind executing market orders with spread and slippage awareness.",
        "Apply executing market orders with spread and slippage awareness to chart evidence without promising a trading outcome.",
        "Document invalidation and risk controls before demonstrating the skill."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "解释在考虑点差与滑点的情况下执行市价单背后的核心决策规则。",
        "将在考虑点差与滑点的情况下执行市价单应用于图表证据，同时不承诺交易结果。",
        "在展示技能前记录失效条件与风险控制。"
      ]
